    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/4c/Lobrydaqbulb.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240506021612\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Lobrydaqbulb\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/4c/Lobrydaqbulb.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240506021612\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"921\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Lobrydaqbulb.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Lobrydaqbulb.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eDevil\u0027s Marionette\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA beatiful warrior and a treasure hunter who ended up being manipulated by an evil hand extending from the demon world, after she had broken a relic seal. She shows tricky battle styles with her crossbow.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/2a/SLobrydaqbulb.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240506021610\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"SLobrydaqbulb\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/2a/SLobrydaqbulb.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240506021610\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1035\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"SLobrydaqbulb.jpg\" data-image-key=\"SLobrydaqbulb.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/c0/Lobryda_DM_Circus_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260120000403\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Lobryda DM Circus Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wi